### 4. Scene 03: The Acquisition Pipeline (Continuous Buyer Journey)
- **Header:** `SCENE 03 — THE ACQUISITION PIPELINE`
- **Heading:** `One seamless acquisition path.`
- **Subtext:** *"Every private client moves through an encrypted, friction-free journey — from initial enquiry to key handover."*
- **Visual Flow:** Luminous energy pulses traveling along a continuous pipeline:
  $$\text{Private Enquiry} \longrightarrow \text{KYC Verification} \longrightarrow \text{VR Walkthrough} \longrightarrow \text{Escrow Setup} \longrightarrow \text{Private Viewing} \longrightarrow \text{Notary Sign-off} \longrightarrow \text{Key Handover}$$

