- **Heading:** `Engineered for your portfolio.`
- **Subtext:** *"One standard of excellence, multiple asset classes. Select an archetype to inspect the acquisition blueprint."*
- **Segmented Control (Pill Switcher):**
  - `Ultra-Luxury Residential` | `Branded Hotel Residences` | `Private Islands` | `Commercial Flagships`
